{{!< default}}
{{#contentFor "moHead"}}
<title>Year-End Giving | Mere Orthodoxy</title>
<meta name="description" content="Help Mere Orthodoxy meet its $125,000 year-end goal. Give online or become a Lifetime member. You can also gift a membership or give by stock, donor-advised fund or check." />
<meta property="og:title" content="Year-End Giving at Mere Orthodoxy" />
<meta property="og:description" content="Help us meet our $125,000 year-end goal and build on 2026." />
<meta property="og:image" content="{{asset "images/year-end/share.jpg"}}" />
<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
<meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
<meta property="og:image:alt" content="Issues of the Mere Orthodoxy journal on green gingham under pine boughs and red berries" />
<meta name="twitter:title" content="Year-End Giving at Mere Orthodoxy" />
<meta name="twitter:description" content="Help us meet our $125,000 year-end goal and build on 2026." />
<meta name="twitter:image" content="{{asset "images/year-end/share.jpg"}}" />
<meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Issues of the Mere Orthodoxy journal on green gingham under pine boughs and red berries" />
{{/contentFor}}
{{!-- /year-end/ — the 2026 year-end giving page (custom-year-end.hbs,
     2026-11-13). One place for every way to support Mere Orthodoxy
     through December: the goal and a progress meter, online giving,
     Lifetime, gift memberships, regular membership, and stock, DAF and
     check. Routed in routes.yaml; until that upload, a Ghost Page with
     the slug "year-end" and this template selected serves it.

     WEEKLY METER UPDATE (Mark sends the total; we update once a week)
     Change these three things together in .eoy-meter below, then push:
       1. raised:    the "$25,000" in .eoy-meter-raised
       2. to go:     the "$100,000" in .eoy-meter-left (125,000 minus raised)
       3. percent:   aria-valuenow, the width on .eoy-meter-fill, and the
                     aria-valuetext (raised / 125,000, rounded down)
     The meter says "Updated weekly" (Ian, 2026-11-13), not a date, so
     a week without an update shows nothing stale. Keep to the weekly
     rhythm.

     Member state: paid and comped readers already have a membership, so
     the "Become a Member" card is hidden for them and the Lifetime card
     points at the upgrade on /membership/. --}}

<main class="eoy">

  <section class="hero eoy-hero" aria-labelledby="eoy-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eoy-hero-grid">
        <div class="eoy-hero-content">
          <h1 class="hero-headline eoy-headline" id="eoy-title"><span class="highlight">Help us build</span> on 2026.</h1>
          <p class="hero-sub">This year our readership more than doubled. Our year-end goal is $125,000. The work we have planned for 2027 depends on reaching it.</p>

          <div class="eoy-meter">
            <p class="eoy-meter-figures">
              <span class="eoy-meter-raised">$25,000</span>
              <span class="eoy-meter-goal">raised of $125,000</span>
            </p>
            <div class="eoy-meter-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Year-end giving" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="20" aria-valuetext="$25,000 of $125,000 raised">
              <span class="eoy-meter-fill" style="width: 20%"></span>
            </div>
            <p class="eoy-meter-meta">
              <span class="eoy-meter-left">$100,000 to go</span>
              <span class="eoy-meter-asof">Updated weekly</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a href="/donate/" class="btn btn-solid btn-primary btn-lg" data-hm-goal="eoy-give">Make a gift</a>
            <a href="#ways" class="btn btn-lg">See every way to give</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="eoy-hero-image">
          <img src="{{asset "images/year-end/hero.jpg"}}"
               alt="Issue 011 of the journal on a wooden stool in striped window light"
               width="1400" height="933" fetchpriority="high" />
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="eoy-year" aria-labelledby="eoy-year-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eoy-year-grid">
        <div class="eoy-year-intro">
          <h2 class="section-heading eoy-year-heading" id="eoy-year-title">What You Made Possible This Year</h2>
          <p>2026 was a loud year. Through it we tried to offer something steadier: patient, rooted thinking about faith and the culture we live in. It came from dozens of writers and guests and from our editors, Jake Meador and Nadya Williams.</p>
          <p>In 2027 we plan to redesign the journal to make it the premier Christian print publication. We also are planning to expand in other exciting ways to help bring Christian renewal for the common good. Both depend on this campaign.</p>
          <img class="eoy-year-photo" src="{{asset "images/year-end/year-reader.jpg"}}" alt="A reader in an orange shirt at a cafe table looking up from the open journal" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <ul class="eoy-year-list">
          <li>A new website and Mere Orthodoxy on Substack.</li>
          <li>Twice as much writing as the year before.</li>
          <li>A fourth issue of the print journal each year.</li>
          <li><a href="/the-faith-received/">The Faith Received</a>: 19,318 works of Christian theology from the Fathers to the Reformers and after.</li>
          <li>Two new podcasts. One of them is <a href="/daily-liturgy/">The Daily Liturgy</a>, morning prayer read aloud each day.</li>
          <li><a href="/events/">Online forums</a> where Members put their questions to the authors of new books.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="eoy-ways" id="ways" aria-labelledby="eoy-ways-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <h2 class="section-heading" id="eoy-ways-title">Ways to Give</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="eoy-ways-grid">
        <li class="eoy-way">
          <img class="eoy-way-photo" src="{{asset "images/year-end/way-give.jpg"}}" alt="A stack of journal issues on a wooden stool in a patch of sunlight" width="900" height="600" loading="lazy" />
          <h3 class="eoy-way-title">Give online</h3>
          <p class="eoy-way-body">Give once or every month. A gift of $1,000, $2,500 or $5,000 goes a long way toward the goal. Gifts of $250 and $500 move it too.</p>
          <p class="eoy-way-note">Tax-deductible through the Institute for Christianity and Common Life.</p>
          <a href="/donate/" class="btn eoy-way-btn" data-hm-goal="eoy-give">Make a gift</a>
        </li>
        <li class="eoy-way">
          <img class="eoy-way-photo" src="{{asset "images/year-end/way-lifetime.jpg"}}" alt="A stack of journal issues on a wooden stool with their spines facing out" width="900" height="600" loading="lazy" />
          <h3 class="eoy-way-title">Lifetime membership</h3>
          <p class="eoy-way-price">$995 once</p>
          <p class="eoy-way-body">Membership for the rest of your life, plus two one-year gift memberships to give to friends or family. $500 of it is tax-deductible and goes toward resources like The Faith Received.</p>
          {{#match @member.status "paid"}}
            <p class="eoy-way-alt">Already Lifetime? <a href="/give/lifetime/" data-hm-goal="eoy-lifetime-gift">Give one as a gift.</a></p>
            <a href="/membership/#lifetime-upgrade" class="btn eoy-way-btn" data-hm-goal="eoy-lifetime">Upgrade to Lifetime</a>
          {{else}}{{#match @member.status "comped"}}
            <p class="eoy-way-alt">Already Lifetime? <a href="/give/lifetime/" data-hm-goal="eoy-lifetime-gift">Give one as a gift.</a></p>
            <a href="/membership/#lifetime-upgrade" class="btn eoy-way-btn" data-hm-goal="eoy-lifetime">Upgrade to Lifetime</a>
          {{else}}{{#match @member.status "gift"}}
            <p class="eoy-way-alt">Already Lifetime? <a href="/give/lifetime/" data-hm-goal="eoy-lifetime-gift">Give one as a gift.</a></p>
            <a href="/membership/#lifetime-upgrade" class="btn eoy-way-btn" data-hm-goal="eoy-lifetime">Upgrade to Lifetime</a>
          {{else}}
            <a href="/membership/" class="btn eoy-way-btn" data-hm-goal="eoy-lifetime">Choose Lifetime</a>
          {{/match}}{{/match}}{{/match}}
        </li>
        <li class="eoy-way">
          <img class="eoy-way-photo" src="{{asset "images/year-end/way-gift.jpg"}}" alt="Three issues of the journal on a round wooden tray among flocked evergreens" width="900" height="600" loading="lazy" />
          <h3 class="eoy-way-title">Gift a Membership</h3>
          <p class="eoy-way-price" data-sale-ends="2027-03-01T06:00:00Z"><span data-full="Starts at $10/month">Starts at $8/month</span> <s data-sale-only><span class="visually-hidden">was </span>$10</s></p>
          <p class="eoy-way-body">Every gift membership includes the print journal. You choose the day it arrives, and your recipient adds a mailing address when they claim it.</p>
          <a href="/give/" class="btn eoy-way-btn" data-hm-goal="eoy-gift">Gift a Membership</a>
        </li>
        {{#match @member.status "paid"}}{{else}}{{#match @member.status "comped"}}{{else}}{{#match @member.status "gift"}}{{else}}
        <li class="eoy-way">
          <img class="eoy-way-photo" src="{{asset "images/year-end/way-member.jpg"}}" alt="A reader in an orange shirt reading the journal at a cafe table with a coffee" width="900" height="600" loading="lazy" />
          <h3 class="eoy-way-title">Membership</h3>
          <p class="eoy-way-price">Starts at $8/month <s><span class="visually-hidden">was </span>$10</s></p>
          <p class="eoy-way-body">20% off your first three months. Members get the print journal four times a year. They can also listen to every article and read every past issue online.</p>
          <p class="eoy-way-alt">Prefer annual? <a href="/eoy-2026-annual/" data-hm-goal="eoy-member-annual">$80 for your first year, usually $100.</a></p>
          <a href="/eoy-2026-monthly/" class="btn eoy-way-btn" data-hm-goal="eoy-member">Become a Member</a>
        </li>
        {{/match}}{{/match}}{{/match}}
      </ul>

      <div class="eoy-other">
        <div class="eoy-other-item">
          <h3 class="eoy-other-title">Stock or a donor-advised fund</h3>
          <p>You can give appreciated stock directly, or give from a donor-advised fund. <a href="/contact/">Write to us</a> and our publisher Mark Kremer will send you what you need.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="eoy-other-item">
          <h3 class="eoy-other-title">By check</h3>
          <p>Make it out to the Institute for Christianity and Common Life and mail it to:</p>
          <address class="eoy-address">2040 South Street<br />Lincoln, NE 68502</address>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="eoy-thanks" aria-labelledby="eoy-thanks-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eoy-thanks-inner">
        <figure class="eoy-thanks-book">
          <img src="{{asset "images/year-end/lord-is-my-light.jpg"}}"
               alt="The Lord Is My Light: A Liturgy for Daily Prayer in blue cloth stamped in gold"
               width="520" height="784" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <div class="eoy-thanks-text">
          <h2 class="section-heading" id="eoy-thanks-title">A Thank You Book</h2>
          <p>We will send a thank-you book to everyone who gives $500 or more, starts a monthly gift of $50 or more, or becomes a Lifetime Member. The book is <cite>The Lord Is My Light: A Liturgy for Daily Prayer</cite>, compiled by Trevin Wax. It sets Scripture among confessions and prayers from believers across the centuries.</p>
          <p class="eoy-thanks-follow">We report our progress in <a href="/#digest">the Weekly Digest</a> every Thursday.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{!-- The reader quotes and "What You're Supporting" from /membership/
       (partials/membership-body.hbs and partials/membership-supporting.hbs),
       wrapped in .membership so the same phone rules apply. Set roman here:
       no italics on this page (Deslop D25). --}}
  <div class="membership eoy-proof">
    <section class="readers">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-intro">
          <h2 class="section-heading">From Our Readers</h2>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="reader-feature">I'm very grateful for the work of Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy. It has been a genuine companion on my spiritual journey.</blockquote>

        <div class="readers-grid">
          <blockquote class="reader-quote">
            <p>Thank you for offering thoughtful, reasonable and decent commentary. It is a boon to my sanity at this stage of my life in this cultural moment.</p>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote class="reader-quote reader-quote--long">
            <p>I used to be a campus minister with a parachurch organization. In finding Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy, it has felt like a little more balance in perspectives like I had when I worked for the ministry. Appreciate your work as it grows my faith.</p>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote class="reader-quote">
            <p>Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy is (for me) a counterpoint to social media, a place of depth and critical thought.</p>
          </blockquote>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="reader-feature reader-feature--coda">I love Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy! One of the best protestant publications out there!</blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="included">
      <div class="container">
        {{> "membership-supporting"}}
        <div class="included-cta">
          <a href="/donate/" class="btn btn-solid btn-dark btn-inline" data-hm-goal="eoy-give-supporting">Make a gift</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

</main>
<script src="{{asset "js/page/gift-checkout.js"}}"></script>
